// SYN-SHELL's Windows resources. Its manifest (resource 1 of type 24,
// RT_MANIFEST), which makes UTF-8 the code page (see syn-shell.manifest),
// and its icon, syn-shell.svg drawn at every size (syn-shell-ico.ps1);
// IDI_ICON1 is the name Qt takes the window's icon from by default.
1 24 "syn-shell.manifest"
IDI_ICON1 ICON "syn-shell.ico"
